<title>USA: UtiliCorp United issues $100 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>UtiliCorp United issues $100 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from UtiliCorp United Inc was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Donaldson, Lufkin &amp; Jenrette.</p>
<p>BORROWER UTILICORP UNITED INC</p>
<p>AMT $100 MLN	  COUPON 6.70 PCT   MATURITY 10/15/06</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES	ISS PRICE 99.956  FIRST PAY DATE 4/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY BAA3     YIELD 6.71 PCT    PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P BBB	  SPREAD 45 BP	PUT OPTION IN FIVE YEARS</p>
<p>NOTES PRICED OVER U.S. TREASURY WHEN-ISSUED FIVE-YEAR</p>
<p>--U.S. corporate bond unit, 212-859-1672</p>
</text>
